er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nIt makes sense to be able to commit default environment settings to version control, so that different team members in a project see the same thing when editing scenes with the preview environment.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- The **Reset to Default** buttons should be disabled when all properties are set to their default values.\r\n- The **Shadow Enabled** checkbox should use a CheckButton node instead as per UX conventions, as it applies immediately. I also suggest giving it some text, so it's easier to click (it can just be \"Enabled\").\r\n\r\nFurther improvements that could be done:\r\n\r\n- Add `Reload` icons to **Reset to Default** buttons and `Add` buttons to the **Add Sun/Environment to Scene** buttons.\r\n- Use `set_visible(false)` on the preview DirectionalLight3D node when the sun energy is set to `0.0` to improve rendering performance. This isn't needed if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102353 is merged, but this may be good to do as a stopgap.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751#pullrequestreview-2618237542","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102751","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751#pullrequestreview-2618237542"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102751"}